# Biometric data never belongs in a repository, in any letter case; scripts/privacy-guard.sh
# also fails on these names, and on the hex dumps and long lines no pattern catches.
*.[Pp][Gg][Mm]
*.[Vv][Aa][Rr][Ii][Aa][Nn][Tt]
*.[Ii][Oo][Cc][Tt][Ll]
*.[Uu][Mm][Oo][Cc][Kk][Dd][Ee][Vv]
*.[Pp][Cc][Aa][Pp]
*.[Pp][Cc][Aa][Pp][Nn][Gg]
**/var/lib/fprint/

*.key
*.swp

/target/
**/*.rs.bk
/_build/
/out/
